# Upstream project pin — single source of truth for reproducible builds.
# homebridge is packaged from the official homebridge-apt-pkg deb
# (homebridge/homebridge-apt-pkg, Apache-2.0) — self-contained: bundles its
# own Node.js runtime (glibc 2.28+, compatible with TOS 7's glibc 2.35).
# IMPORTANT: the payload ships VERBATIM — streamed member-by-member from the
# upstream data.tar.xz, never staged on disk (Windows cannot represent the
# relative symlinks bin/npm -> ../lib/node_modules/...). Upstream paths stay
# at /opt/homebridge + /var/lib/homebridge (start.sh hardcodes them; storage
# is cwd-relative). Only a TOS-hardened systemd unit, TOS metadata
# (config.ini/lang/icon) and docs are added by this repository.

UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/homebridge/homebridge-apt-pkg
UPSTREAM_LICENSE=Apache-2.0

